OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny rain
OL,6,Fsoon clearing, a dry night with cloudy
OL,7,Fperiods to follow. Feeling cool in
OL,8,Frural parts as temperatures drop to
OL,9,Fsingle figures, allowing fog patches
OL,10,Fand a grass frost to develop. Warmer
OL,11,Fin cities and along the Kent coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAny fog soon clearing to leave
OL,14,Fhazy sunshine for most of the day.
OL,15,FFeeling warm in the afternoon
OL,16,Fsunshine. Rain may affect Kent and
OL,17,FSussex by the evening and overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
