OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fand partly cloudy on Tuesday, very
OL,7,Fwarm by the afternoon and unusually
OL,8,Fmild overnight. Rain, followed by the
OL,9,Fodd heavy shower, on Wednesday.
OL,10,FShowers possible for some on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
